# C1 host contracts statement gate: cut checks

Tool: `bash <S>/tools/leanelab.sh <S>/wt-g5c1 <S>/oleans-f8 <file>` (direct `lean`, no `-o`,
no olean written). Checkout: `wt-g5c1`, campaign commit 1781a230 (PR #84, fills-8), read-only.
Snapshot: `oleans-f8` (all of TCSlib at that commit). Toolchain: `leanprover/lean4:v4.25.0`.
<OUT> is the gate's output directory; <S> the scratchpad. Run: 2026-10-14 03:09 UTC.

`python3 -I <OUT>/scripts/cutcheck.py <OUT>/C1Hosts.lean <S>/wt-g5c1 <OUT>/cut` (the stage-2
gate's script, verbatim) writes, for each part, a file holding the imports of the part's import
closure and the bodies of the parts in that closure, in file order. Each is elaborated on its own.
