## Landing modules as they would land (`<OUT>/scripts/mklanded.py` -> `<OUT>/landed/`)

Each new module is the copyright block, its part's imports, the options and the part; the
addition to `Nondeterministic.lean` is the checkout's file with the extra import and the part
appended. A file is elaborated standalone only when every module it imports exists in the
snapshot; the other two import new modules and are covered by the cut checks above.
